@startuml
title TriageDesk — arquitectura acordada y componentes de P6
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
actor "Cliente\nSwagger / Postman" as cliente
component "api-gateway :8080\nP1 · Java / Spring Cloud Gateway" as gateway
component "user-service :8083\nP3 · Java / Spring Security" as usuarios
component "ticket-service :8081\nP2 · Core / Hexagonal" as tickets
component "classification-service :8082\nP4 · Python / FastAPI" as clasificador
component "notification-service :8084\nP5 · NestJS" as notificaciones
cloud "Proveedor LLM" as llm
database "users_db\nPostgreSQL" as usersdb
database "tickets_db\nPostgreSQL" as ticketsdb
database "classification_db\nMongoDB" as classificationdb
database "notifications_db\nMongoDB" as notificationsdb
package "reporting-service :8085 · P6 · implementado en esta rama" #E7F4EF {
  component "EventosController\nPOST /api/eventos" as eventos
  component "EventosService\nValidacion e idempotencia" as consumidor
  component "Strategy\nSeis proyectores" as proyectores
  component "TicketViewRepository\nUpsert atomico" as vistasrepo
  component "EventoProcesadoRepository\nInbox persistente" as inboxrepo
  component "ReportesController\nGET /api/reportes/*" as reportes
  component "ReportesService\nDTO y porcentajes" as consultas
  component "ReportesRepository\nAgregaciones MongoDB" as lecturasrepo
  component "HealthController\nGET /health" as health
  component "Common\nCorrelationId / errores / logs" as common
}
database "reporting_db\nMongoDB standalone\nticket_view\neventos_procesados" as reportingdb #E7F4EF
cliente --> gateway : HTTP + JWT
gateway --> usuarios : login / usuarios
gateway --> tickets : tickets
gateway --> notificaciones : consultas
gateway --> reportes : AGENTE / ADMIN
tickets --> clasificador : REST / timeout / fallback
clasificador --> llm : clasificacion
usuarios --> usersdb
tickets --> ticketsdb
clasificador --> classificationdb
notificaciones --> notificationsdb
tickets --> notificaciones : eventos HTTP
tickets --> eventos : eventos HTTP internos
eventos --> consumidor
consumidor --> inboxrepo : guardar / confirmar
consumidor --> proyectores : seleccionar por eventType
proyectores --> vistasrepo : proyeccion
vistasrepo --> reportingdb
inboxrepo --> reportingdb
reportes --> consultas
consultas --> lecturasrepo
lecturasrepo --> reportingdb
health --> reportingdb : ping
eventos ..> common
reportes ..> common
note bottom of gateway
  Los componentes de P1–P5 representan
  la arquitectura acordada en CONTEXTO_PROYECTO.md.
  Su implementacion no se certifica en esta rama.
  /api/eventos no se publica por el gateway.
end note
note bottom of reportingdb
  Ningun servicio lee bases ajenas.
  P6 proyecta snapshots; no calcula prioridades.
  La demo local utiliza un MongoDB temporal separado.
end note
@enduml
